Note on scope: this MIT License applies to the source code (scripts/,
utils/) and this repository's written material (README, code comments,
docstrings) only.

Third-party datasets used by this toolkit are NOT bundled in this
repository and remain subject to their own original licenses:

- Global Solar Atlas 3.0 (World Bank Group / Solargis) - CC BY 4.0
- GADM v2.8 / v4.1 - academic and non-commercial use only; redistribution
  or commercial use requires prior permission
- OCHA Haiti / CNIGS, via Humanitarian Data Exchange - CC BY-IGO

See the "Data sources" section of the README and the "provenance" block
of each config/<country>.json for full per-country attribution
requirements. Each user must independently obtain raw data under the
original provider's terms - see data/raster/README.md and
data/vectors/README.md for download instructions.

Academic citation: if you use this repository in academic work, please
cite it using the metadata in CITATION.cff.